{
  "description": "LT1: one case per refusal and per allowed case of the unregistered-literal census (scripts/lib/config_check.py). Each case is a source text, its kind (.py, .sh, .mjs) and the literals the census must find, as [kind, value]. The texts live here, in data, so the test file itself spells none of them.",
